---
layout: none
permalink: /wire/details-nkev.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  T-0532 part S, design section 5: the nKEVs tab's Details fact sheet, written at build
  from the same wire.yml the page rendered, so a page and its file always come from one
  build (the section's data-details version query carries the same generated_at). Rows
  are guarded exactly as the page guards them: a CVE id in CVE shape and a ten-character
  added day, which makes the row count equal the tab's. Every data value is emitted
  through | jsonify; the per-row object and its per-field guards are
  _includes/wire-details-row.html. Not in site search: no layout (pagefind indexes HTML
  only) and sitemap off.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign wire = site.data.wire -%}
{"generated_at": {{ wire.vulns_generated_at | jsonify }}, "rows": {
{%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for r in wire.vulns -%}
{%- assign cve_head = r.cve | slice: 0, 4 -%}{%- assign added_len = r.added | size -%}
{%- if cve_head == "CVE-" and added_len == 10 -%}
{%- unless first -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- assign first = false -%}
{%- include wire-details-row.html r=r -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
}}
